# Hilt DI Patterns

## Annotations

| Class type | Annotation |
|---|---|
| ViewModel | `@HiltViewModel` + `@Inject constructor` |
| Store | `@Singleton` + `@Inject constructor` |
| Repository | `@Singleton` + `@Inject constructor` |
| Network | `@Singleton` + `@Inject constructor` |

## Qualifiers

- `@IoDispatcher` for IO-bound work (network, disk)
- `@MainDispatcher` for UI work
- `@ApplicationScope` for process-lifetime coroutines (Store observers)

## Constructor visibility

All constructor params must be `private val`:

```kotlin
// ❌ BAD
class FooViewModel @Inject constructor(
    val repository: FooRepository
)

// ✅ GOOD
class FooViewModel @Inject constructor(
    private val repository: FooRepository
)
```

## Eager initialization

Stores that observe socket events must be injected into `HomeViewModel` to ensure they are created when the user logs in, not when a specific screen is opened.
